      Every dietary pattern CookTwo supports, with the evidence verdict, the honest strength and the honest cost. I would rather hand a client the studies than an opinion, so every card links to a full guide that wears its evidence grade in the open — including the ones whose marketing budgets outran their footnotes. Guides open in the same window so you can read in order.
